{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A housewife saved <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6323c421910797baa6bfe47f8cfa15443f7ad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{2.50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> in buying a dress on sale. If she spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9953d821307721859c206f2ec5bc6ea689f65d94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> for the dress, she saved about: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a3ad8f75129593fd3722ad67f7977e1e550eaf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\% \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 9 \\% \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\% \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 11 \\% \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"451\" height=\"17\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since she saved <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6323c421910797baa6bfe47f8cfa15443f7ad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{2.50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> and spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9953d821307721859c206f2ec5bc6ea689f65d94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, the original price of the dress was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf7971574c89c811a53cf539e7f2d76c957a0a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{27.50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. The percent saved can be modeled as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b115a68c88142c13fe398d4a423225f7c1afeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27.5x=2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c122b6b2149256aacd3f5d8846859accb24f1f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{2.5}{27.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/1/95187b90a61ece6bde465b8f0d9c2432c63539cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/f/9afac94fcdeab8ebde74dee7b8b7e20e1077255e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9\\% \\implies \\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problem